AB  - We witness an increasing usage of AI-assistants even for routine (classroom) programming tasks. However, the code generated on basis of a so called “prompt” by the programmer does not always meet accepted security standards. The actual quality of the programmers’ prompt determines whether generated code contains weaknesses or not.
